# Spider Food: "target ... creature with flying" is any creature with flying, one of the caster's own included. Bot1's own
# Ornithopter (0/2, flying) is destroyed and Bot1 still gets the Food token; Bot2's Ornithopter is not touched.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Ornithopter
Spider Food
Forest x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x19

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Hand.Spider Food.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Spider Food; Ornithopter; Black Lotus
Bot1.Battlefield = Food Token
Bot2.Battlefield = Ornithopter
